"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 August to September ran 36% of normal, and in 2026 so far March to April ran 156%. Grid 22353 had its driest year in 1976 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
